<title>SOUTH AFRICA: SAFRICA MONEY MKT SHORTAGE RISES TO 10.29 BLN RAND.</title>
<headline>SAFRICA MONEY MKT SHORTAGE RISES TO 10.29 BLN RAND.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-03-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Africa's money market shortage rose to 10.285 billion rand on Monday from 10.078 billion on Saturday, the Reserve Bank said.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom, +27 11 482-1003</p>
